WEBVTT

00:02:56.579 --> 00:03:00.913
Low levels of serotonin,
a neurotransmitter connected to arousal,

00:03:00.954 --> 00:03:04.038
may make depressed individuals
less attentive to new information.

00:03:04.079 --> 00:03:08.288
Dwelling on sad events in the past,
another symptom of depression,

00:03:08.329 --> 00:03:10.788
makes it difficult 
to pay attention to the present,

00:03:10.829 --> 00:03:13.288
affecting the ability 
to store short-term memories.

00:03:13.329 --> 00:03:18.371
Isolation, which is tied to depression,
is another memory thief.

00:03:18.413 --> 00:03:22.288
A study by the Harvard 
School of Public Health

00:03:22.329 --> 00:03:25.663
found that older people
with high levels of social integration

00:03:25.704 --> 00:03:28.496
had a slower rate of memory decline
over a six-year period.

00:03:28.538 --> 00:03:31.079
The exact reason remains unclear,
but experts suspect